                                    <span style="font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; color:#ccc; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><i class="fa fa-bars" style="color:#555;"></i> Compose Newsletter</span>
                                    <i class="fa fa-chevron-down" style="color:#555; font-size:12px;"></i>
                                </div>
