					<i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="margin-right:10px;"></i>Privacy Policy
				</h4>
				<small style="color:#666;display:block;margin-top:4px;">Last Updated: 31 March 2026</small>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-body" style="max-height:65vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:28px 30px;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>1. Introduction</h5>
				<p>Welcome to the official website of <strong style="color:#fff;">Thabiso Mhlongo</strong>. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us.</p>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-database" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>2. Information We Collect</h5>
				<ul style="color:#bbb;line-height:1.9;padding-left:20px;">
					<li><strong>Contact &amp; booking forms:</strong> Name, email, phone, event details, and notes.</li>
					<li><strong>Newsletter subscriptions:</strong> Your email address.</li>
					<li><strong>Technical/usage data:</strong> IP address, browser type, and pages visited via server logs.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect payment card details &mdash; payments are processed securely by PayFast.</p>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-gears" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>3. How We Use Your Information</h5>
				<ul style="color:#bbb;line-height:1.9;padding-left:20px;">
					<li>To respond to contact and booking requests.</li>
					<li>To send newsletters to opted-in subscribers.</li>
					<li>To generate booking quotes and email correspondence.</li>
					<li>To improve website performance and security.</li>
					<li>To comply with applicable legal obligations.</li>
				</ul>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-cookie-bite" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>4. Cookies &amp; Local Storage</h5>
				<ul style="color:#bbb;line-height:1.9;padding-left:20px;">
					<li><strong>Session cookies:</strong> Admin authentication sessions only.</li>
					<li><strong>Local storage:</strong> Cookie consent preference and personalisation settings.</li>
					<li><strong>Third-party embeds:</strong> YouTube, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook may set their own cookies.</li>
				</ul>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>5. Your Rights (POPIA)</h5>
				<p>Under South Africa&rsquo;s <strong style="color:#fff;">POPIA</strong>, you have the right to access, correct, or delete your data, and to unsubscribe from newsletters at any time. Contact: <a href="mailto:bookings@thabisomhlongo.com" style="color:#D4AF37;">bookings@thabisomhlongo.com</a></p>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>6. Data Security</h5>
				<p>We implement bcrypt password hashing, session-based authentication, rate limiting on public forms, and duplicate submission prevention.</p>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>7. Changes to This Policy</h5>
				<p>We may update this policy at any time. Continued use of the website after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="modal-footer" style="background:#0e0e0e;border-top:1px solid #2a2a2a;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 24px;">
				<small style="color:#555;">Thabiso Mhlongo &mdash; bookings@thabisomhlongo.com</small>
				<button type="button" class="btn" data-dismiss="modal" style="background:#D4AF37;color:#111;font-weight:700;border:none;padding:8px 22px;border-radius:3px;">Close</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

