				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>6. Privacy</h5>
				<p>Use of this website is also governed by our <a href="#" data-dismiss="modal" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#privacyModalAdmin" style="color:#D4AF37;">Privacy Policy</a>, incorporated into these Terms by reference.</p>
				<hr style="border-color:#2a2a2a;">
				<h5 style="color:#D4AF37;"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced" style="margin-right:7px;"></i>7. Governing Law</h5>
				<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the <strong style="color:#fff;">Republic of South Africa</strong>.</p>
